&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.v2dao.com/contents/jiao-shi-mu-jie-qi-fei-ZbqA" style="color: #fff; background: #e74c3c; padding: 14px 36px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 1.3em; font-weight: bold; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.15); display: inline-block;"&gt;前往查看详情&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id="简介"&gt;简介&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;清水附中，温柔美母班主任夏宫瑶，清冷处女英语老师楚凝月，傲娇校花姐姐林韵，三具美艳的胴体，却都沉沦在我的巨根下。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id="章节列表"&gt;章节列表&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.v2dao.com/contents/jiao-shi-mu-jie-qi-fei-ZbqA/reader/1" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;第一章 地铁上，温柔教师美母被儿子粗暴寝取，堕落沦为儿子的淫乱喷汁性奴肉便器&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://www.v2dao.com/contents/jiao-shi-mu-jie-qi-fei-ZbqA/reader/2" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;第二章 教师美母课后辅导，自慰勾引儿子教室中出，窗前爆肏失禁高潮成肥臀婊子&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://www.v2dao.com/contents/jiao-shi-mu-jie-qi-fei-ZbqA/reader/3" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;第三章 在妈妈的助攻下为校园女神单独训练瑜伽，和男友只隔着一门之隔被媚药调教成性奴母狗的清冷女教师&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;a href="https://www.v2dao.com/contents/jiao-shi-mu-jie-qi-fei-ZbqA/reader/4" style="color: #fff; background: #3498db; padding: 10px 20px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 1em; font-weight: 500; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); display: inline-block; margin: 5px;"&gt;第四章【最终篇】假期回家的欲女姐姐亲眼目睹母子禁忌不伦现场，门口自慰却被弟弟发现，强行抱进房间中出爆肏&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>